[5127]={ -- Fimble Finespindle
  ["Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, adventurer, those were the days...."]=1,
  ["Nope, can't help you, I'm afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's amazing!"]=2,
  ["Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time."]=3,
},
[5141]={ -- Theodrus Frostbeard
  ["The Light protect you, $c."]=1,
  ["I hope the Light is with you, adventurer. Is there anything I can do for you today?"]=2,
